OL,3,AAt least 27 dead and hundreds evacuated
OL,4,Aafter strike on Kyiv warehouse
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Tkachenko said a 14-year-old
OL,7,Fwas killed in a separate attack in the
OL,8,FBoryspil district as President
OL,9,FVolodymyr Zelensky reported overnight
OL,10,Fstrikes across several regions.
